{"id":"b5795bc870ceffc9","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-martingale-convergence.md","title":"Martingale Convergence","display":"df-martingale-convergence — Martingale Convergence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-martingale-convergence","aliases":["58-df-martingale-convergence"],"display":"df-martingale-convergence — Martingale Convergence","depends_on":["[[58-df-martingale]]","[[58-df-integral]]","[[58-df-measurable-function]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-martingale-convergence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-martingale-convergence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-martingale-convergence — Martingale Convergence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"51dcf9111a1a952a\" href=\"?note=51dcf9111a1a952a\" title=\"58-df-martingale\">58-df-martingale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"58-df-integral\">58-df-integral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_\\bullet,M_\\infty,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P\\in V\">\\(M_\\bullet,M_\\infty,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P\\in V\\)</span> (process, limit, filtration, and probability-space data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-theoretic function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M_\\bullet,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M_\\bullet,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\omega)\\)</span> (typed martingale predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"51dcf9111a1a952a\" href=\"?note=51dcf9111a1a952a\" title=\"58-df-martingale\">58-df-martingale</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S\\)</span> (real-valued measurable-function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int_E f\\,d\\mathbb P\">\\(\\int_E f\\,d\\mathbb P\\)</span> (Lebesgue integral, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"58-df-integral\">58-df-integral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UIConvergentMartingale}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{UIConvergentMartingale}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}martingale\\text{-}convergence} \\vdash \\mathrm{UIConvergentMartingale}_S(M_\\bullet,M_\\infty,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M_\\bullet,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(M_\\bullet,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(M_\\infty;\\Omega,\\mathcal A)\\land\\int_\\Omega|M_\\infty|\\,d\\mathbb P&lt;\\infty\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists K\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\\int_{\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:\\,|M_\\bullet(n)(\\xi)|&gt;K\\}}|M_\\bullet(n)|\\,d\\mathbb P&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\land\\left\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}M_\\bullet(n)(\\xi)=M_\\infty(\\xi)\\right\\}\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\left\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}M_\\bullet(n)(\\xi)=M_\\infty(\\xi)\\right\\}\\right)=1\\land\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\int_\\Omega|M_\\bullet(n)-M_\\infty|\\,d\\mathbb P=0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}martingale\\text{-}convergence} \\vdash \\mathrm{UIConvergentMartingale}_S(M_\\bullet,M_\\infty,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M_\\bullet,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(M_\\bullet,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(M_\\infty;\\Omega,\\mathcal A)\\land\\int_\\Omega|M_\\infty|\\,d\\mathbb P&lt;\\infty\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists K\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\\int_{\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:\\,|M_\\bullet(n)(\\xi)|&gt;K\\}}|M_\\bullet(n)|\\,d\\mathbb P&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\land\\left\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}M_\\bullet(n)(\\xi)=M_\\infty(\\xi)\\right\\}\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\left\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}M_\\bullet(n)(\\xi)=M_\\infty(\\xi)\\right\\}\\right)=1\\land\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\int_\\Omega|M_\\bullet(n)-M_\\infty|\\,d\\mathbb P=0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Uniform integrability and both convergence modes are expanded against the same explicit probability-space data; the limit is explicitly measurable and integrable, and its almost-sure convergence event is explicitly measurable.</li>\n<li>Doob's theorem supplies existence of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_\\infty\">\\(M_\\infty\\)</span> for uniformly integrable martingales.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"51dcf9111a1a952a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-martingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-integral","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-integral]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable-function","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measurable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-theoretic function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"51dcf9111a1a952a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M_\\bullet,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\omega)$ (typed martingale predicate, see [[58-df-martingale]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-integral","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\int_E f\\,d\\mathbb P$ (Lebesgue integral, see [[58-df-integral]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M_\\bullet,M_\\infty,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M_\\bullet,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\int_E f\\,d\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UIConvergentMartingale}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}martingale\\text{-}convergence} \\vdash \\mathrm{UIConvergentMartingale}_S(M_\\bullet,M_\\infty,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M_\\bullet,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(M_\\bullet,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(M_\\infty;\\Omega,\\mathcal A)\\land\\int_\\Omega|M_\\infty|\\,d\\mathbb P<\\infty\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists K\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\\int_{\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:\\,|M_\\bullet(n)(\\xi)|>K\\}}|M_\\bullet(n)|\\,d\\mathbb P<\\varepsilon\\right)\\land\\left\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}M_\\bullet(n)(\\xi)=M_\\infty(\\xi)\\right\\}\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\mathbb P\\!\\left(\\left\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega:\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}M_\\bullet(n)(\\xi)=M_\\infty(\\xi)\\right\\}\\right)=1\\land\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\int_\\Omega|M_\\bullet(n)-M_\\infty|\\,d\\mathbb P=0","display":true},{"tex":"M_\\infty","display":false}],"bytes":2178,"backlinks":[{"id":"59ee0c08880a79d3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-820","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-martingale-convergence.md|58-df-martingale-convergence]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["51dcf9111a1a952a","4884f45058a56aac","bbbec05fde1d3b01","36d7463d215be751"]}